        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that these industries provide a good fit for our solutions and services, as these industries typically have the greatest analytic potential with large and growing data volumes, complex data management requirements, large and varied types of users, and operations and customer bases that span global geographies.",
